    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Paige M.",
        "date": "2025-09-29T06:11:00Z",
        "id": "68dbd48d66d17d5525a08be9",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Sep 30, 2025",
            "id": "441a7e9e-3f82-4f17-8248-e790daf7198d",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you so much for choosing our home for such a special occasion! We are thrilled to hear the location, community, and home itself worked so well for your group and that you had an amazing time overall.\n\nWe do apologize for the challenges you experienced with the golf cart, pool code, and smoke detector. While we are glad our team was friendly and able to assist, we regret the timing of the golf cart repair and any inconvenience caused.\n\nIt is wonderful to know these issues did not take away from your celebration, and we truly appreciate your kind words and willingness to book again. We would love to host you and your group for another memorable stay in the future!\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was very clean.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was more than satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nI planned my sister’s bachelorette & we found this house and immediately fell in love! Location was PERFECT, 4 minute walk to the beach, right next to town, it was perfect. The community was super inviting and everyone was friendly. The house itself - when we showed up there was MANY bugs, but we learned that’s just a Florida thing. There ended up being only 8 of us, so the house was nice and cozy for the group of us. Easy to go to and from, and overall beautiful :)We did have to call a few times about a few issues, our golfcart was dead the whole weekend. There was nothing to help get that charged unfortunately and no one was able to come until the day we left (literally showed up as we were pulling out. We also had to call about a dead smoke detector that was beeping 😅 the guy who came to fix it was SUPER sweet and fixed it. We were given the wrong pool code so we didn’t get to use the pool until the maintenance guy told us the actual code. Everyone was super friendly when we had called. Overall: It was an amazing experience despite some small issues, I would book again for sure!",
        "title": "Wonderful!"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kaylea C.",
